otherapy plugin is installed, replace with [gototherapy_therapist_grid] -->\n<div data-page=\"directory\">\n<div class=\"section__head section__head--split\">\n<h2 class=\"h2\">Verified therapists in Brighton</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\" data-directory-count=\"\">Loading verified profiles…</p>\n</div>\n</div>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "21e9e23", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<!-- Functional block, kept verbatim. When the Gototherapy plugin is installed, replace with [gototherapy_therapist_grid] -->\n<div class=\"profile-grid\" data-directory-results=\"\">\n<article class=\"card card--hover profile-card\">\n<div class=\"profile-card__badges\"><span class=\"badge badge--verified\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Register, insurance and supervision checked</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--demo\">Demo record</span></div>\n<div class=\"profile-card__top\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"avatar\">TA</span>\n<div><h3 class=\"profile-card__name\"><a href=\"/therapist/demo-therapist-a/\">Demo Therapist A</a></h3><p class=\"profile-card__role\">Counsellor (demo record)</p></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"profile-card__meta\"><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21s-6-5.2-6-10a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 4.8-6 10-6 10z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Brighton</span></li><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" width=\"13\" x=\"3\" y=\"6\"></rect><path d=\"m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3z\"></path></svg><span>In person and Online</span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"profile-card__text\">Works with anxiety, relationships, work and stress.</p>\n</article><article class=\"card card--hover profile-card\">\n<div class=\"profile-card__badges\"><span class=\"badge badge--verified\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Register, insurance and supervision checked</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--demo\">Demo record</span></div>\n<div class=\"profile-card__top\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"avatar\">TB</span>\n<div><h3 class=\"profile-card__name\"><a href=\"/therapist/demo-therapist-b/\">Demo Therapist B</a></h3><p class=\"profile-card__role\">Psychotherapist (demo record)</p></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"profile-card__meta\"><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21s-6-5.2-6-10a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 4.8-6 10-6 10z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Brighton</span></li><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" width=\"13\" x=\"3\" y=\"6\"></rect><path d=\"m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3z\"></path></svg><span>Online</span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"profile-card__text\">Works with anxiety, depression and low mood, bereavement and loss.</p>\n</article><article class=\"card card--hover profile-card\">\n<div class=\"profile-card__badges\"><span class=\"badge badge--verified\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Register, insurance and supervision checked</span></span><span class=\"badge badge--demo\">Demo record</span></div>\n<div class=\"profile-card__top\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"avatar\">TE</span>\n<div><h3 class=\"profile-card__name\"><a href=\"/therapist/demo-therapist-e/\">Demo Therapist E</a></h3><p class=\"profile-card__role\">Counsellor (demo record)</p></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"profile-card__meta\"><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 21s-6-5.2-6-10a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 4.8-6 10-6 10z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>Brighton</span></li><li><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon--sm\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect height=\"12\" rx=\"2\" width=\"13\" x=\"3\" y=\"6\"></rect><path d=\"m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3z\"></path></svg><span>In person and Online</span></li></ul>\n<p class=\"profile-card__text\">Works with anxiety, bereavement and loss, life changes.</p>\n</article>\n</div>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "26249de", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "row", "_css_classes": "gt-actions", "flex_direction_tablet": "row", "flex_direction_mobile": "row", "flex_align_items": "center", "flex_gap": {"column": "12", "row": "12", "unit": "px", "size": 12}, "flex_gap_tablet": {"column": "32", "row": "32", "unit": "px", "size": 32}, "flex_wrap": "wrap"}, "elements": [{"id": "3c90cb4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Filter Brighton therapists by issue", "link": {"url": "/find-a-therapist/?location=brighton", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "gt-button-ghost", "size": "md"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f200472", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "About online counselling", "link": {"url": "/online-counselling/", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "gt-button-ghost", "size": "md"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "b86ce53", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-section gt-band", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#EBE5DB"}, "elements": [{"id": "6440285", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "row", "_css_classes": "gt-row", "flex_direction_tablet": "column", "flex_direction_mobile": "column", "flex_align_items": "center", "flex_gap": {"column": "48", "row": "32", "unit": "px", "size": 48}, "flex_gap_tablet": {"column": "32", "row": "32", "unit": "px", "size": 32}}, "elements": [{"id": "a9823fa", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-col", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 50.0}, "width_tablet": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}}, "elements": [{"id": "133d268", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Looking for a therapist in Brighton", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "gt-h2"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f95d09e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Looking for a therapist in Brighton is easier than in most towns of its size, and harder than it looks. There are a lot of practitioners, spread between the city centre, Hove, Kemptown and the villages along the Downs. Parking near the seafront is expensive and slow. Most people choose somewhere on a bus route or within a short walk of Brighton or Hove station, and many therapists offer early morning or evening hours because so many clients commute to London.</p><p>Brighton has two universities and a large student population, which means there are practitioners who work a great deal with people in their late teens and twenties. It also has a long-established LGBTQ+ community, and a number of therapists say plainly on their profiles that this is where much of their work sits. The creative and digital industries are a large local employer, and freelancers and people between contracts make up a noticeable part of many caseloads.</p><p>Online sessions are common here. Some people choose them because a lunchtime slot from a shared flat or a co-working space is easier than a journey across the city. Others start online with a therapist in Brighton and move to the room later, or keep working online when they leave for a job elsewhere. If the therapist you want to see is in Hove and you are in Saltdean, online may be the difference between going and not going.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-prose"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": 